353 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The use of these laws to harass and intimidate media personnel, human rights activists, political activists, artists, and public intellectuals despite a Supreme Court ruling narrowing its application, shows that the very existence of sedition laws on the statute books is a threat to democratic values. We recommend the following changes to bring this aspect of Indian laws in tune with most modern democratic frameworks including the United Kingdom, USA, and New Zealand. )
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [8 9]
>>
